"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D2_ITALYA_AVRUPA:-1549-01-01:0":{"b": ["El Argar (utamaduni wa Argar, Antas): utamaduni wamalizika (takriban)", "0272e861"], "d": ["Jamii ya Enzi ya Shaba yenye awamu tatu, makazi ya vilimani, na kiwango cha dola ya awali Iberia Kusini-Mashariki; ~35.000 km2 katika kilele chake.", "3b8cc665"]},
